            "value" : "तपाईंको खर्च ब्याकअप भई आफ्ना सबै यन्त्रहरूमा सिंक हुन्छ।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your expenses are saved on this device only. Sign in with Apple to back them up and sync across your devices." : {
